Spec: SDDRelations
→: next stage / execution transition
->: dependency
=>: produces
<-: produced by
@: reference
!: finding/failure marker by context
?: unknown marker by context
Rules:
  Relations are directional.
  → is execution order.
  -> is dependency.
  => is produced output.
  @ resolves an SDD entity.
  ? MUST NOT be silently converted to a known value.
